{
  "key": 18231,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "SurvivalArea_Text_ThisIsMyPlace",
      "en_US": [
        "Buck: Yo, if it isn’t {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "This! It’s my place!\n",
        "Drop in, hey?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Cornil: Yo, mais c’est {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Regarde, c’est chez moi!\n",
        "Entre un moment!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SurvivalArea_Text_DoorMembersOnly",
      "en_US": [
        "The door is shut tight.\n",
        "“Members Only” is painted on it."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "La porte est fermée à clé.\n",
        "C’est marqué “Réservé aux membres”."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SurvivalArea_Text_IllProveImTougher",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}! You\n",
        "aren’t the only one getting tougher!\r",
        "I’ll prove it to you!\n",
        "Let’s go!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hé, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}! Il\n",
        "n’y a pas que toi qui fais des progrès!\r",
        "Je vais te le prouver!\n",
        "En garde!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SurvivalArea_Text_KeepGettingTougher",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ...!\r",
        "It’s all right, though.\n",
        "Keep getting tougher, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}.\r",
        "The more you do, the tougher my\n",
        "Pokémon and I get, too.\r",
        "There’s no end to Pokémon.\n",
        "That’s what I’m saying, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ...!\r",
        "Bah, c’est pas grave.\n",
        "Continue comme ça, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}.\r",
        "Plus tu t’entraînes, plus mes Pokémon\n",
        "et moi on devient forts.\r",
        "Les Pokémon ont des talents infinis.\n",
        "C’est moi qui te le dis, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SurvivalArea_Text_PilingUpWins",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\n",
        "How are you doing?\r",
        "Me? You even need to ask?\n",
        "Piling up the wins at the Battle Tower!\r",
        "Huh? My longest winning streak?\n",
        "What, you’re going to grill me now?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hé, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\n",
        "Comment ça va?\r",
        "Moi? La question ne se pose même pas!\n",
        "J’enchaîne les victoires à la Tour\f",
        "de Combat, bien sûr!\r",
        "Mon record de victoires consécutives?\n",
        "Tu as l’intention de me cuisiner ou quoi?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SurvivalArea_Text_DidYouBattleEveryone",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Oh, it’s you,\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}.\r",
        "Did you battle with everyone?\r",
        "Don’t you think it’s kind of cool,\n",
        "though?\r",
        "When people talk about Pokémon, they\n",
        "all start smiling!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Oh, c’est toi,\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}.\r",
        "Tu as combattu tout le monde?\r",
        "Tu trouves pas ça super?\r",
        "Dès qu’ils parlent de Pokémon, les gens\n",
        "se mettent à sourire!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SurvivalArea_Text_BestTrainersLovePokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ...!\n",
        "Oh, it’s you, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}.\r",
        "You know, the best Trainers must really\n",
        "love Pokémon from their heart.\r",
        "I’m talking about people like the Gym\n",
        "Leaders, of course.\r",
        "People like the Tower Tycoon and the\n",
        "other Frontier Brains, too.\r",
        "You can tell they love Pokémon when\n",
        "you’re battling them.\r",
        "But I’m not conceding anything to\n",
        "them, or to you!\r",
        "Because I’m still going to be the\n",
        "greatest Trainer ever!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ...!\n",
        "Oh, c’est toi, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}.\r",
        "Tu sais, les meilleurs Dresseurs doivent\n",
        "aimer les Pokémon du fond du cœur.\r",
        "Les Champions d’Arène par exemple.\r",
        "Et les Meneurs de Zone, comme l’Aigle\n",
        "Tour, aussi.\r",
        "Il suffit de se battre contre eux pour\n",
        "que ça saute aux yeux.\r",
        "Mais c’est pas pour autant que je vais\n",
        "me laisser intimider!\r",
        "J’ai toujours l’intention de devenir le\n",
        "meilleur Dresseur de tous les temps!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SurvivalArea_Text_BagFullOfItems",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey, traveling Trainer.\n",
        "Is your big Bag full of items?\f",
        "Or is it full of dreams?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Eh, Dresseur en vadrouille.\n",
        "Ton Sac est plein d’objets?\f",
        "Ou peut-être est-il plein de rêves?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SurvivalArea_Text_ComeHereToTrain",
      "en_US": [
        "Trainers who lose at the Battle\n",
        "Frontier come here to train."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Les Dresseurs qui perdent dans la\n",
        "Zone de Combat viennent ici pour\f",
        "essayer d’être moins nuls."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SurvivalArea_Text_ScoreCommemorativePrints",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m taking the Frontier challenges to\n",
        "score some commemorative prints."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je relève des défis à la Zone de Combat\n",
        "pour gagner des photos-souvenirs."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SurvivalArea_Text_IFilmedRedGyarados",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m a Cameraman, obviously.\r",
        "Have you seen that TV program,\n",
        "“Search for the Red GYARADOS!”?\r",
        "Yeah, that outstanding documentary!\n",
        "I filmed that!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je suis Caméraman. \n",
        "Oui, je sais que ça se voit.\r",
        "Tu as vu cette émission, “A la \n",
        "recherche du LEVIATOR rouge!”?\r",
        "Eh bien, ce documentaire de \n",
        "génie, c’est moi qui l’ai filmé!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SurvivalArea_Text_AllSetToProduce",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m a Cameraman, obviously.\r",
        "“The Eruption of Stark Mountain?\n",
        "The mystery of the fiery Pokémon\f",
        "asleep deep in the volcano!”\r",
        "I was all set to produce that\n",
        "documentary, but it’s a no go.\r",
        "There’s not much of a show without\n",
        "capturing HEATRAN on film.\r",
        "Oh, well. The world’s a huge place.\n",
        "There’re plenty of other mysteries!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je suis Caméraman. \n",
        "Oui, je sais que ça se voit.\r",
        "“L’éruption du Mont Abrupt.\n",
        "Le mystère du Pokémon de feu endormi\f",
        "au fin fond du volcan!”\r",
        "J’avais tout préparé pour réaliser ce\n",
        "documentaire, mais c’est peine perdue.\r",
        "Eh oui, sans aucune image d’HEATRAN,\n",
        "c’est mal parti.\r",
        "Bah, le monde est grand et plein de\n",
        "mystères!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SurvivalArea_Text_AllMappedOut",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m a Cameraman, obviously.\r",
        "“The Eruption of Stark Mountain?\n",
        "The mystery of the fiery Pokémon\f",
        "asleep deep in the volcano!”\r",
        "I’ve had that documentary all mapped\n",
        "out in my head for a long time...\r",
        "But I have nothing on film as of yet.\n",
        "So much for that show.\r",
        "Oh, well. The world’s a huge place.\n",
        "There’re plenty of other mysteries!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je suis Caméraman. \n",
        "Oui, je sais que ça se voit.\r",
        "“L’éruption du Mont Abrupt.\n",
        "Le mystère du Pokémon de feu endormi\f",
        "au fin fond du volcan!”\r",
        "J’ai ce projet de documentaire en \n",
        "tête depuis un bon moment.\r",
        "Mais je n’ai encore rien filmé... \n",
        "C’est mal parti.\r",
        "Bah, le monde est grand et \n",
        "plein de mystères!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SurvivalArea_Text_MapSign",
      "en_US": [
        "Survival Area\n",
        "Staging Point"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aire de Survie\n",
        "Camp de base"
      ]
    }
  ]
}